            <ArticleTitle>Impact of multislice CT on imaging of acute abdominal disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1083-93</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The increased speed, greater coverage, and thinner slices of MSCT are exciting developments in radiology, and these feature should only improve with newer generation multislice scanners. The impact of this technology on abdominal imaging has just begun.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
